stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unassigned: Guest message processed
  Unassigned --> AutoHandling: Validated FAQ/low-risk path
  Unassigned --> QueuedHuman: Explicit human or safety trigger
  AutoHandling --> QueuedHuman: Low confidence / denied action / repeated confusion
  AutoHandling --> AutoHandling: Evidence-backed answer
  QueuedHuman --> AssignedHuman: Authorized receptionist claims
  QueuedHuman --> Escalated: Unacknowledged by approved SLA
  Escalated --> AssignedHuman: Supervisor assigns staff
  AssignedHuman --> HumanWorking: Staff replies and/or owns task
  HumanWorking --> Resolved: Guest request completed with evidence
  HumanWorking --> Escalated: Shift ends / needs specialist
  Resolved --> AutoHandling: Staff explicitly releases and guest re-engages
  Resolved --> [*]: Conversation archived per retention
  note right of QueuedHuman
    Agent must NOT respond as human.
    Show actual queue status, hours and alternative contact.
  end note
  note right of HumanWorking
    AI generation paused for conversation.
    Automation may only send approved administrative notices.
  end note
